DATA ATTRIBUTION

Match data is collected from the official Indian Premier League website
(https://www.iplt20.com/) via its public JSON feeds, supplemented for the
2008-2018 seasons by Cricsheet (https://cricsheet.org/), which publishes under
the Open Data Commons Attribution License.

